{
  "id": "GEN.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Omochakano 22",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu okoborigwa arue Isaka abe ekeng’wanso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaba magega y’amang’ana ayio, Nyasae akabeekera Aburaamu ogoteemwa. Akamorangeria: “Aburaamu!” Na Aburaamu akamoitabeera. “Nao inde aa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae akamoteebia: “Moire Isaka, omwana oyo oo omomoima, oyobwanchete, ogende nere goika ense ya Moria. Agwo omorue abe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa ase egetunwa ekemo ki’ebio ndakworokie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu akaimoka mambia chuni, akabeeka ebinto ase etigere yaye, akairana abamura babere amo nere, na Isaka omwana oye. Agaatia chinko agochia gosambera ekeng’wanso, akaimoka, akagenda gochia aase aria ateebetigwe na Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria gatato Aburaamu akaimokereria amaiso aye igoro, akarora aase aria korwa aare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Aburaamu agateebia abamura baria abaarenge komo: “Ikaransa inwe aiga amo netigere eye! Inche amo nomwana oyo one nkogenda tore gochia aria, tosasime, erio toirane ase more naende.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu akaimokia chinko echi areenge gochia gosambera ekeng’wanso, agatweka Isaka omwana oye, na ere omonyene akaimokia omorero na omoyio. Bakagenda amo bonsi babere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaka agakwana na Aburaamu ise, agateeba: “Tata!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ise agoitaba ogoteeba: “Nao inde aa, omwana one.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaka akamobooria: “Rora, omorero ne chinko ntobwate, korende ng’ai emaanwa y’eng’ondi ere togochia gokorera ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu akamoiraneria: “Omwana one, Nyasae nenyorere emaanwa y’eng’ondi ase ekeng’wanso eke.” Erio bakagenderera amo bonsi babere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobaikire aase aria ateebetigwe na Nyasae, Aburaamu akaagacha egesasiimero agwo, akaara chinko igoro yaye, agasiba Isaka omwana oye, akamwareria igoro ye chinko chiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Aburaamu akarambora okoboko kwaye, akabogoria omoyio anyenye omwana oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende omomalaika Omonene akamorangeria korwa igoro, akabora: “Aburaamu, Aburaamu!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ere agaitaba: “Nao inde aa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omomalaika oria akamoteebia: “Torambora okoboko kwao igoro ase omwana oo, gose tomokorera ing’ana rinde rionsi riibe. Bono namanyire ng’a nomoirogete Nyasae, naende narorire ng’a tondineti omwana oo omomoima.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu akaimokerereria amaiso aye igoro, akaonchora ebigoti gochia aa anaaria, akarora eng’ondi emingichi ebwatire ching’unchara ase orosana nemerande. Aburaamu akagenda, akarusia eng’ondi eyio, akayerua, ekaba ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa ase ribaga ri’omwana oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aburaamu Akaaroka aase aria “Omonene nayaroke” (Yahwe‐Yire);",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "buna abanto bagokwana goika reero iga: “Ase egetunwa ki’ Omonene, nao ekonyorekana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omomalaika Omonene akarangeria Aburaamu korwa igoro eria kabere, akamoteebia:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene oteebire: Netianirie inche omonyene, ekiagera gwakorire ring’ana eri, gose tondineti omwana oo omomoima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ogosesenia ningosesenie, na ase okomenta nimente ororeeria rwao, robe oronge buna ching’enang’eni chia igoro na buna omokenye ore engegu y’enyancha, na ororeeria rwao inarobue emechie y’ababisa babo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ase ororeeria rwao ebisaku bionsi bi’ense inabisesenigwe, ekiagera kwanyigwereire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Aburaamu akairana gochia ase abamura baria baarenge komo; bonsi bakaimoka, bakagenda amo gochia Beeri‐Seba; na Aburaamu akaba okomenya agwo Beeri‐Seba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ororeeria rwa Nahori",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’amang’ana ayio kaerire Aburaamu agateebigwa ng’a, “Milka oiboreire momura omino Nahori abana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana abwo nabwo aba: Usi, omwana oye omotangi, na Busi omwabo, na Kemueli, ise Aramu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Kesedi, na Haso, na Pilidasi, na Yidilafu, na Betueli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Betueli nere omoiborete omoiseke ore korokwa Rebeka. Abwo batano na batato nabwo Milka aiborerete Nahori, momura omwabo Aburaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende omokungu oye o sere‐sere, ore korokwa Reuma, akamoiborera Teba, na Gahamu, na Tahasi, na Maaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "GEN.23",
